      <rules>
        <rule name="Jade Fury" id="5f1e-bfb1-a402-8b37" hidden="false">
          <description>While an opposing unit contains one or more models with the Hazard Critical Damage Effect, it is Burning. 


When a Burning unit is Activated, its Admiral must make a Group Crew Check for it. If the test is failed, each model in the unit gains 1 level of Disorder.


In addition, if a model in a Burning unit were to gain a fourth level of Disorder for any reason, that model also immediately suffers 1 Damage. The Disorder then Spreads as normal.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </forceEntry>
