      <rules>
        <rule name="Abyssal Terror" id="2614-5f0d-f084-4015" hidden="false">
          <description>When making an Attack action with an Empire Underwater unit with the Surfacing status, this Admiral may, at the start of the Count Hits step, choose to discard a Victory &amp; Valour Card. 


If they do so, convert all Standard Counters in the Action Roll to Standard Strikes.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </forceEntry>
