    <forceEntry name="Chita-Swarm Battlefleet (Main)" id="e0c9-e3ca-71cb-bb86" hidden="false" sortIndex="2">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Chita-Strike" id="07d8-c4e2-d9c6-90a2" hidden="false">
          <description>When a Japanese unit in this Force declares an Attack action in which all Contributing weapons have both the Submerged and Torpedo qualities, this Admiral may declare that they are performing a Chita-Strike. 


If they do so, they may discard any number of Escort tokens from the attacking unit. For each Token discarded, add 3 Action Dice to the Action Pool. Additionally, for each Token discarded, add the Breach (1) quality to one Contributing weapon.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
