      <rules>
        <rule name="Monument of Fire" id="e411-e099-6469-6b1f" hidden="false">
          <description>In the End Phase of each Round, in the Complete Objectives step, this Admiral may discard a Victory &amp; Valour Card from their hand.


If they do so, they score a number of Victory Points equal to the Mass of the largest Magma Formation wholly in their opponent’s Half of the Play Area.</description>
